  "title": "Growing Up Guidewire: COO Priscilla Hung Talks Innovation, Diversity & More",
  "summary": "Give it up for one of the original Girls in Tech! After having the absolute privilege of working with Guidewire President and COO Priscilla Hung for 15 years and counting, I've learned to listen to every word she says. She has been a fantastic leader and role model to me, and she's the reason I am a Girls in Tech board member today. But most important of all, she's an inspiration to women throughout the industry. Which makes this recent podcast interview appointment listening.",
